  <title>SET SECONDS Command</title>
  <keywords>
    <keyword>Commands</keyword>
    <keyword>SET commands</keyword>
    <keyword>SET SECONDS command</keyword>
  </keywords>
  <body>
    <header>
      <para styleclass="Heading1">SET SECONDS Command</para>
    </header>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><snippet src="__FoxProOnly" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><snippet src="__CommandInclude" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">Purpose</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">Specifies whether the seconds are displayed in the time portion of a DateTime value.</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">Syntax</para>
    <para styleclass="Code with box">SET SECONDS ON | OFF | &amp;&lt;cMacro&gt;</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">Arguments</para>
    <para styleclass="List">ON | OFF<tab />ON displays the seconds. OFF suppresses them. The value may also be a macro (&amp;) that evaluates to ON or OFF.</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">Remarks</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">SET SECONDS is equivalent to the function <link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="html\Overload_XSharp_Core_Functions_SetSeconds.htm" domain="XSharpRef.chm">SetSeconds()</link>.</para>
    <para styleclass="Body Text"><snippet src="__IncludeLibVFP" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">See Also</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="command_SET_HOURS">SET HOURS</link>, <link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="command_SET_TIME">SET TIME</link>, <link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="html\Overload_XSharp_Core_Functions_SetSeconds.htm" domain="XSharpRef.chm">SetSeconds()</link></para>
  </body>
</topic>
